  \begin{itemize}[itemsep=10pt]
    \item Classical neuroanatomy lacked resolution and scale for complete circuit-level wiring diagrams
    \item Understanding brain information processing demands detailed maps of neural connectivity
    \item EM, automated segmentation, and computational advances now make large-scale connectomics feasible
  \end{itemize}
